# **/results/*

.claude/
# --- Magnitude-law campaign: valuable research artifacts must be backed up (2026-07-09) ---
# Override the global **/*.md and **/*.txt ignores for the campaign's docs, plans, and job specs.
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/handoff/*.md
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/jobs/*.txt
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/paper/**/*.md
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/paper/**/*.txt
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/papers/*.pdf
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/*.md
# Re-include the repo agent definitions (parent .claude/ is ignored above)
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/

# geometry-drift regenerable intermediate (3.4GB of base-W SVD tensors)
notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/results/geo_drift/base_svd/

# results book (auto-generated presentation tables) must be tracked despite **/*.md
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/results_book/
!notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/results_book/*.md

# External reference clone (upstream LLM-Adapters), not part of this repo
notebooks/catastrophic forgetting/repro/LLM-Adapters/
